      "title": "dfilter: Prevent flex from printing backslash to console",
      "message": "dfilter: Prevent flex from printing backslash to console\n\nFlex doesn't allow putting other patterns together with <<EOF>>\nin a rule. We need to match a backslash with nothing following\n(after the rules with a backslash with a character following) so\nthat the backslash isn't written to the console via the default\nrule.\n\nIt might be cleaner to do escape sequences with another state\ntransition for backslashes.\n",
